{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55312","headline":"赠邓洵美 · 李昉","name":"赠邓洵美","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔词场共着鞭，当时莺谷喜同迁。\n关河契阔三千里，音信稀踈二十年。\n君遇已知依玉帐，我无才藻步花砖。\n时情人事堪惆怅，天外相逢一泫然。\n（见《增修诗话总龟》卷十四引《雅言系述》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李昉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55312.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55312","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}